    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Of the five memory exercises, two are really hard, and the "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "other"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " three are much easier."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "在这五项记忆练习中，有两项真的很难，另外三项则容易得多。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "New Zealand has two islands. One is North Island and "
