  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "other 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握其习惯用法，及比较与 another 的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "1) "
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "the other"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 指两者中的另一个，常与 one 连用，构成 one…and the other 结构；"
        },
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "another"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 则指三个以上的另一个。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：There are two new students in our class. One is from Japan and "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "the other"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " is from Australia. 我们班有两个新同学。一个来自日本，另一个来自澳大利亚。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I don’t like this shirt. Could you show me "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "another"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " one?"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我不喜欢这件衬衫。能给我看看另一件吗？"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "2) the others = the other + 复数名词，是特指一定范围内的剩下的那一些人或事物；而 others = other + 复数名词，是泛指，没有一定的范围。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：There are ten students in our group. Four are girls, and "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "the others"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " are boys."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我们组有 10 个学生。4 个女孩，其他是男孩。"
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Some people like ball games, but "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "others"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " don’t."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "有些人喜欢球类运动，而另一些人不喜欢。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
